GQ2) Fields: In which fields are GNN models most commonly applied?
GQ3) Journals: In which journals are the papers on GNNs published? Are these journals chosen because of the specific domain of application, or not?
GQ4) Research groups: Which are the most active research groups on GNNs?
GQ5) Tools: What tools (programming languages, libraries, frameworks) are used to implement the GNN models?
